9a2fc85.png","width":917,"height":381,"width_mm":107.774,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2512-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 17 题参考答案：（共 12 分）\n（1）设金属圆盘转动产生的电动势为 E，则"},{"type":"math","value":"E = \\frac {1}{2} B \\omega r ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"E = 1 2. 5 \\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":"设电容器所带的电荷量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = E C"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 0. 7 5 \\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n判断："},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":"极板带正电\n(1 分)\n(2) ① 设金属棒刚开始运动时电流为 I，加速度为 a，则"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac {E}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"I = 2. 5 \\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac {B I d - \\mu m g}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"a = 2 0 \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n② 设金属棒的最大速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，最大速度时电流为 i，电容器电压为 U，则"},{"type":"math","value":"B i d = \\mu m g"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"i = 0. 5 \\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"math","value":"U = i R + B d v _ {m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设在达到最大速度过程中通过金属棒的电量为 q，则"},{"type":"math","value":"q = (E - U) C"},{"type":"text","value":"在达到最大速度过程中，由动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"B d q - \\mu m g t = m v _ {m} - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {m} = 2. 5 \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）由于回路电阻为零，金属棒产生的电动势等于自感电动势，则"},{"type":"math","value":"B d v _ {0} = L \\frac {\\Delta i}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"i = 2 0 t (\\mathrm{A})"},{"type":"text","value":"设金属棒匀速运动"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}=1m"},{"type":"text","value":"时的电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {0} = 1 0 \\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n方法 1:"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{0}=W=\\frac{1}{2}(0+BI_{0}d)x_{0}=5.0J"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n方法 2:"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{0}=\\frac{1}{2}LI_{0}^{2}=5.0J"},{"type":"text","value":"方法 3:"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{0}=Bdv_{0}q_{0}=Bdv_{0}(\\frac{1}{2}I_{0}t)=5.0J"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhuji-zhenduan-2512-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--zhuji-zhenduan-2512","source_question_id":"zhuji-zhenduan-2512-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"34347f8cd04085a559f20d6811ea3889cde905e955d80259e0eb5c0899824652","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13 分）如图甲所示为洛伦兹力演示仪的示意图，电子枪可以发射电子束，玻璃泡内有稀薄气体，在电子束通过时能够显示电子的径迹。励磁线圈能够在两个线圈之间产生匀强磁场，磁场方向与两个线圈中心的连线平行。图乙所示为电子枪的电路结构原理图，调节滑动变阻器可以改变电子束发射的速度。现给励磁线圈通上电流，产生磁场的磁感应强度大小为 B，方向垂直纸面向内，电子枪发射的电子由静止开始经加速极加速，水平向左垂直射入磁场，径迹显示电子束运动的半径为 r。已知电子的电荷量为 e，质量为 m，忽略地磁场的影响和气体阻力，假设电子的运动始终在匀强磁场范围内。\n(1) 求电子束运动的速度大小; 若要使径迹半径增大, 则滑动变阻器 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 的触头应 “向左”还是 “向右” 移动?\n(2) 若电子枪发射方向朝纸面内偏转, 使电子速度方向与磁场方向的夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 电子束的径迹为螺旋线, 求电子束径迹的半径大小和螺距大小; (已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 53^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" )\n(3) 若在径迹中心固定一个正电荷, 电量 "},{"type":"math","value":"q = \\frac{6 e B^{2} r^{3}}{k m}"},{"type":"text","value":" (其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 为静电力常数), 调节滑动变阻器, 使电子束径迹的半径大小保持不变, 如图丙所示。\n① 求此时电子枪加速极的加速电压大小；\n②某时刻同时关闭励磁线圈的电流和加速电压，此后任一时刻所有电子位于同一圆周上，圆周的半径在做周期性变化，求圆周最大半径和圆周半径的变化周期；\n(不考虑磁场消失时产生的感应电场；取无穷远处的电势为0，与正点电荷q相距为r处的电势 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi=k\\frac{q}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":" )\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bbe49b94214a7b3388394cedec4d2c361359240fcc8ee65b97d45f4d39baff5a.png","width":340,"height":239,"width_mm":39.899,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2512-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题 图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/56a40d3a049b8f79b6e42dcbdd0165bdb099230ddf94ac4b7d97c2ec32120f1e.png","width":399,"height":375,"width_mm":46.826,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2512-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题 图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/111f593562503d8e242cda5d4a9b74cdce6175a9a7ae700cba331cca6868529e.png","width":376,"height":362,"width_mm":44.096,"row_group":"zhuji-zhenduan-2512-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题 图丙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 18 题参考答案：（共 13 分）\n（1）电子做匀速圆周运动，由向心力公式"},{"type":"math","value":"B e v = m \\frac {v ^ {2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得："},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac {B e r}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n滑动变阻器 R 的触头应 “向左” 移动\n(1 分)\n（2）设电子束径迹的半径大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，电子垂直磁场方向速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，电子沿磁场方向速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {1} = v \\sin \\theta = 0. 8 v \\quad v _ {2} = v \\cos \\theta = 0. 6 v"},{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"r _ {1} = \\frac {m v _ {1}}{B e}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"r _ {1} = 0. 8 r"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设电子束运动周期为 T，径迹的螺距大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac {2 \\pi m}{B e}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"x _ {0} = v _ {2} T = \\frac {1 . 2 \\pi m v}{B e} = 1. 2 \\pi r"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）① 在径迹中心固定一个正电荷，由库仑力和洛伦兹力提供向心力，设电子束速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"k \\frac {q e}{r ^ {2}} + B e v _ {3} = m \\frac {v _ {3} ^ {2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {3} = \\frac {3 B e r}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设电子枪加速极的加速电压为 U，则"},{"type":"math","value":"U e = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {3} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac {9 B ^ {2} e r ^ {2}}{2 m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n② 磁场消失，电子做离心运动，轨迹为椭圆，设最远点离正电荷距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"，速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"，类比开普勒第二定律，电子与正电荷连线在相等时间内扫过的面积相等，则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} v _ {3} \\Delta t r = \\frac {1}{2} v _ {4} \\Delta t r _ {4}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {3} r = v _ {4} r _ {4}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n由能量关系"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} m v _ {3} ^ {2} - k \\frac {q e}{r} = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {4} ^ {2} - k \\frac {q e}{r _ {4}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n圆周最大半径："},{"type":"math","value":"r _ {4} = 3 r"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n该椭圆运动的半长轴为"},{"type":"math","value":"2r"},{"type":"text","value":"，周期相当于半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"2r"},{"type":"text","value":"的圆周运动的周期，即"},{"type":"math","value":"k \\frac {q e}{(2 r) ^ {2}} = m \\frac {4 \\pi^ {2}}{T ^ {2}} (2 r)"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac {4 \\sqrt {3} \\pi m}{3 B e}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}}]}
